OL,3,CProgramme listings for FRI 2 JAN
OL,4,G1930FFriday Night is Music Night
OL,5,     GThe BBC Concert Orchestra and
OL,6,     Gconductor Daniel Parkinson invite
OL,7,     Gyou to dance the night away with
OL,8,     Gsinger Madeleine Morgan, and
OL,9,     Ghosts Craig Revel Horwood and
OL,10,     GKatie Derham.
OL,11,G2115FThe Lebrecht Interview
OL,12,     GNorman Lebrecht talks to tenor
OL,13,     GJonas Kaufmann about his life in
OL,14,     Gmusic, from going against his
OL,15,     Gfather's wishes in his early
OL,16,     Gcareer, to his love for languages.
